        <briefdescription>
<para>Multivariate log-gamma function. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes the multivariate log-gamma function, which for real <formula id="6">$\alpha$</formula> and integer <formula id="7">$q$</formula> is defined as the logarithm of</para><para><formula id="8">\[ \Gamma_q(\alpha) = \pi^{q(q-1)/4} \prod_{j=1}^q \Gamma(\alpha + (1-j)/2). \]</formula></para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">alpha</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Real scalar. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">q</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Integer scalar. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The multivariate log-gamma function <formula id="9">$\log \Gamma_q(\alpha)$</formula>. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
